<title>GERMANY: UN's Kofi Annan to visit Germany April 16-18.</title>
<headline>UN's Kofi Annan to visit Germany April 16-18.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany said on Wednesday Kofi Annan will make his first visit to the country as United Nations Secretary-General later this month.</p>
<p>Annan is due to visit Bonn and Berlin from April 16 to 18 for talks with President Roman Herzog, Chancellor Helmut Kohl and other cabinet ministers, a government spokesman told a news conference.</p>
